thyper    ~~ TRestles + TFidgety + TDistrac + TReflect + TAttends
tpeer ~~ TLoner + TFriend + TPopular + TBullied + TOldBest
tprosoc ~~ TConsid + TShares + TCaring + TKind + THelpOut
'

